== _headers full content ==
# Cloudflare Pages 头部规则：wrangler@4 为合并语义，更具体的块继承通配块的头，同名头以更具体块为准。
# 布局：/* 全部安全头在前；/_astro-v2/* 仅追加 immutable 缓存头在后，避免安全头逐条重复。

# 全站默认：安全头。
/*
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.github.com; frame-src https://giscus.app; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000

# 构建产物（带内容哈希，永久缓存）。Astro 的 assets 目录已改为 _astro-v2。
# 安全头由 /* 块合并提供，此处仅声明缓存头。
/_astro-v2/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

== /* block headers (six security headers) ==
  Content-Security-Policy: default-src 'self'; script-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; style-src 'self' 'unsafe-inline'; img-src 'self' data:; connect-src 'self' https://api.github.com; frame-src https://giscus.app; object-src 'none'; base-uri 'self'
  X-Content-Type-Options: nosniff
  Referrer-Policy: strict-origin-when-cross-origin
  Permissions-Policy: camera=(), microphone=(), geolocation=()
  X-Frame-Options: SAMEORIGIN
  Strict-Transport-Security: max-age=31536000
(all six present exactly once; Cache-Control belongs only to the /_astro-v2/* block, see full content above)

